{"id":"a0bddecd0c0bf21b","group":"29","path":"29/29-df-gaifman-normal-form.md","title":"Gaifman 局部正规形式","display":"df-gaifman-normal-form — Gaifman 局部正规形式","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-df-gaifman-normal-form","aliases":["29-df-gaifman-normal-form"],"display":"df-gaifman-normal-form — Gaifman 局部正规形式","depends_on":["[[29-df-vocab]]","[[29-df-formula]]","[[29-df-sentence]]","[[29-df-atomic-formula]]","[[29-df-free-variable]]","[[29-df-bound-variable]]","[[29-df-variable]]","[[29-df-substitution]]"],"source_locator":"Chapter 6 historical notes, p.111, DjVu scan 126","source_basis":"本书该处仅提供 Gaifman 局部性历史引文；以下为显式语法重构，非原书逐字定义或完整证明核验","revision_basis":"本次仅据用户提供的29(1).zip修订；既有原书定位及过往核对叙述为继承记录，未重新取得或查看DjVu原件","revision_verification":"数学类型与接口审查、静态结构及链接检查；未提交证明助理内核证书"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-df-gaifman-normal-form"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-df-gaifman-normal-form</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-gaifman-normal-form — Gaifman 局部正规形式"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"28e86a5f0243a0ae\" href=\"?note=28e86a5f0243a0ae\" title=\"29-df-vocab\">29-df-vocab</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a3fa1d78e657e6a2\" href=\"?note=a3fa1d78e657e6a2\" title=\"29-df-formula\">29-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"711217f22972ffc0\" href=\"?note=711217f22972ffc0\" title=\"29-df-sentence\">29-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"19d380b6c383f76b\" href=\"?note=19d380b6c383f76b\" title=\"29-df-atomic-formula\">29-df-atomic-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"db2b32546860e623\" href=\"?note=db2b32546860e623\" title=\"29-df-free-variable\">29-df-free-variable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"85d0fb57b7114042\" href=\"?note=85d0fb57b7114042\" title=\"29-df-bound-variable\">29-df-bound-variable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"ad08b66c5e54a436\" href=\"?note=ad08b66c5e54a436\" title=\"29-df-variable\">29-df-variable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"cb6b888b6edaf01c\" href=\"?note=cb6b888b6edaf01c\" title=\"29-df-substitution\">29-df-substitution</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Chapter 6 historical notes, p.111, DjVu scan 126"},{"key":"source_basis","html":"本书该处仅提供 Gaifman 局部性历史引文；以下为显式语法重构，非原书逐字定义或完整证明核验"},{"key":"revision_basis","html":"本次仅据用户提供的29(1).zip修订；既有原书定位及过往核对叙述为继承记录，未重新取得或查看DjVu原件"},{"key":"revision_verification","html":"数学类型与接口审查、静态结构及链接检查；未提交证明助理内核证书"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau=\\langle R_1^{(a_1)},\\ldots,R_s^{(a_s)}\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{Vocabulary}\">\\(\\tau=\\langle R_1^{(a_1)},\\ldots,R_s^{(a_s)}\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{Vocabulary}\\)</span> 为有限纯关系词汇，无常量或函数符号，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a_j\\geq1\">\\(a_j\\geq1\\)</span>；不附加序或数值符号。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AtFml}_\\tau,\\mathrm{Fml}_\\tau,\\mathrm{Sent}_\\tau,\\mathrm{FV}_\\tau,\\mathrm{BV}_\\tau\">\\(\\mathrm{AtFml}_\\tau,\\mathrm{Fml}_\\tau,\\mathrm{Sent}_\\tau,\\mathrm{FV}_\\tau,\\mathrm{BV}_\\tau\\)</span> 取所列依赖。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Var}=\\{x_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Var}=\\{x_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\)</span>，索引单射取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"ad08b66c5e54a436\" href=\"?note=ad08b66c5e54a436\" title=\"29-df-variable\">29-df-variable</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y\\in\\mathrm{Var}\">\\(x,y\\in\\mathrm{Var}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r,m\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(r,m\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi[t/x]\">\\(\\psi[t/x]\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"cb6b888b6edaf01c\" href=\"?note=cb6b888b6edaf01c\" title=\"29-df-substitution\">29-df-substitution</a> 的捕获规避替换。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\\subseteq\\mathrm{Var}\">\\(D\\subseteq\\mathrm{Var}\\)</span> 有限；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{fr}(D,m)\">\\(\\operatorname{fr}(D,m)\\)</span> 是下式唯一确定的变量序列；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Vert\">\\(\\Vert\\)</span> 为序列串接。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bigwedge^{\\!*},\\bigvee^{\\!*}\">\\(\\bigwedge^{\\!*},\\bigvee^{\\!*}\\)</span> 是下式从左侧取首项的公式序列折叠，不是未指定括号的集合运算。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle\\theta_i\\rangle_{i=1}^t\">\\(\\langle\\theta_i\\rangle_{i=1}^t\\)</span> 按下标递增；二重下标按字典序；空序列为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle\\rangle\">\\(\\langle\\rangle\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ex}(\\bar z,\\theta)\">\\(\\operatorname{Ex}(\\bar z,\\theta)\\)</span> 是下式个体存在量词序列构造；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar z\\in\\mathrm{Var}^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\bar z\\in\\mathrm{Var}^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>。每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Adj}_\\tau(x,y)\">\\(\\operatorname{Adj}_\\tau(x,y)\\)</span> 中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z_1,\\ldots,z_{a_j}\">\\(z_1,\\ldots,z_{a_j}\\)</span> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{fr}(\\{x,y\\},a_j)\">\\(\\operatorname{fr}(\\{x,y\\},a_j)\\)</span>，每个距离递归步骤的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z\">\\(z\\)</span> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{fr}(\\{x,y\\},1)_1\">\\(\\operatorname{fr}(\\{x,y\\},1)_1\\)</span>；均不采用任何隐含换名。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Loc}_{x,r}\">\\(\\operatorname{Loc}_{x,r}\\)</span> 的定义域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{\\chi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_\\tau:x\\notin\\mathrm{BV}_\\tau(\\chi)\\}\">\\(\\{\\chi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_\\tau:x\\notin\\mathrm{BV}_\\tau(\\chi)\\}\\)</span>；所有递归调用保留同一中心 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to,\\leftrightarrow\\}\">\\(\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to,\\leftrightarrow\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"h_1(D)\\coloneqq\\min\\{i\\in\\mathbb N:x_i\\notin D\\},\\qquad h_{j+1}(D)\\coloneqq\\min\\{i\\in\\mathbb N:i&gt;h_j(D)\\land x_i\\notin D\\},\\qquad\\operatorname{fr}(D,m)\\coloneqq\\langle x_{h_j(D)}\\rangle_{j=1}^m.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[h_1(D)\\coloneqq\\min\\{i\\in\\mathbb N:x_i\\notin D\\},\\qquad h_{j+1}(D)\\coloneqq\\min\\{i\\in\\mathbb N:i&gt;h_j(D)\\land x_i\\notin D\\},\\qquad\\operatorname{fr}(D,m)\\coloneqq\\langle x_{h_j(D)}\\rangle_{j=1}^m.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\bigwedge^{\\!*}\\langle\\rangle\\coloneqq\\top,\\quad\\bigvee^{\\!*}\\langle\\rangle\\coloneqq\\bot,\\quad\\bigwedge^{\\!*}(\\langle\\theta\\rangle\\Vert\\bar\\eta)\\coloneqq\\theta\\land\\bigwedge^{\\!*}\\bar\\eta,\\quad\\bigvee^{\\!*}(\\langle\\theta\\rangle\\Vert\\bar\\eta)\\coloneqq\\theta\\lor\\bigvee^{\\!*}\\bar\\eta.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\bigwedge^{\\!*}\\langle\\rangle\\coloneqq\\top,\\quad\\bigvee^{\\!*}\\langle\\rangle\\coloneqq\\bot,\\quad\\bigwedge^{\\!*}(\\langle\\theta\\rangle\\Vert\\bar\\eta)\\coloneqq\\theta\\land\\bigwedge^{\\!*}\\bar\\eta,\\quad\\bigvee^{\\!*}(\\langle\\theta\\rangle\\Vert\\bar\\eta)\\coloneqq\\theta\\lor\\bigvee^{\\!*}\\bar\\eta.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ex}(\\langle\\rangle,\\theta)\\coloneqq\\theta,\\qquad\\operatorname{Ex}(\\langle z\\rangle\\Vert\\bar u,\\theta)\\coloneqq\\exists z\\,\\operatorname{Ex}(\\bar u,\\theta).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Ex}(\\langle\\rangle,\\theta)\\coloneqq\\theta,\\qquad\\operatorname{Ex}(\\langle z\\rangle\\Vert\\bar u,\\theta)\\coloneqq\\exists z\\,\\operatorname{Ex}(\\bar u,\\theta).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Adj}_{\\tau}(x,y)\\coloneqq\\neg(x=y)\\land\\bigvee^{\\!*}\\left\\langle\\operatorname{Ex}\\left(\\operatorname{fr}(\\{x,y\\},a_j),R_j(z_1,\\ldots,z_{a_j})\\land\\bigvee^{\\!*}\\langle x=z_p\\land y=z_q\\rangle_{(p,q)\\in\\{1,\\ldots,a_j\\}^2}\\right)\\right\\rangle_{j=1}^s,\\qquad(z_1,\\ldots,z_{a_j})=\\operatorname{fr}(\\{x,y\\},a_j).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Adj}_{\\tau}(x,y)\\coloneqq\\neg(x=y)\\land\\bigvee^{\\!*}\\left\\langle\\operatorname{Ex}\\left(\\operatorname{fr}(\\{x,y\\},a_j),R_j(z_1,\\ldots,z_{a_j})\\land\\bigvee^{\\!*}\\langle x=z_p\\land y=z_q\\rangle_{(p,q)\\in\\{1,\\ldots,a_j\\}^2}\\right)\\right\\rangle_{j=1}^s,\\qquad(z_1,\\ldots,z_{a_j})=\\operatorname{fr}(\\{x,y\\},a_j).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\delta_{\\tau,0}(x,y)\\coloneqq x=y,\\qquad\\delta_{\\tau,r+1}(x,y)\\coloneqq\\delta_{\\tau,r}(x,y)\\lor\\exists z\\bigl(\\delta_{\\tau,r}(x,z)\\land\\operatorname{Adj}_{\\tau}(z,y)\\bigr),\\quad z=\\operatorname{fr}(\\{x,y\\},1)_1.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\delta_{\\tau,0}(x,y)\\coloneqq x=y,\\qquad\\delta_{\\tau,r+1}(x,y)\\coloneqq\\delta_{\\tau,r}(x,y)\\lor\\exists z\\bigl(\\delta_{\\tau,r}(x,z)\\land\\operatorname{Adj}_{\\tau}(z,y)\\bigr),\\quad z=\\operatorname{fr}(\\{x,y\\},1)_1.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Loc}_{x,r}(\\theta)\\coloneqq\\theta\\quad(\\theta\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_\\tau),\\qquad\\operatorname{Loc}_{x,r}(\\neg\\chi)\\coloneqq\\neg\\operatorname{Loc}_{x,r}(\\chi),\\qquad\\operatorname{Loc}_{x,r}(\\chi\\circ\\eta)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Loc}_{x,r}(\\chi)\\circ\\operatorname{Loc}_{x,r}(\\eta).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Loc}_{x,r}(\\theta)\\coloneqq\\theta\\quad(\\theta\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_\\tau),\\qquad\\operatorname{Loc}_{x,r}(\\neg\\chi)\\coloneqq\\neg\\operatorname{Loc}_{x,r}(\\chi),\\qquad\\operatorname{Loc}_{x,r}(\\chi\\circ\\eta)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Loc}_{x,r}(\\chi)\\circ\\operatorname{Loc}_{x,r}(\\eta).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Loc}_{x,r}(\\exists y\\,\\chi)\\coloneqq\\exists y\\bigl(\\delta_{\\tau,r}(x,y)\\land\\operatorname{Loc}_{x,r}(\\chi)\\bigr),\\quad\\operatorname{Loc}_{x,r}(\\forall y\\,\\chi)\\coloneqq\\forall y\\bigl(\\delta_{\\tau,r}(x,y)\\to\\operatorname{Loc}_{x,r}(\\chi)\\bigr),\\quad y\\ne x.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Loc}_{x,r}(\\exists y\\,\\chi)\\coloneqq\\exists y\\bigl(\\delta_{\\tau,r}(x,y)\\land\\operatorname{Loc}_{x,r}(\\chi)\\bigr),\\quad\\operatorname{Loc}_{x,r}(\\forall y\\,\\chi)\\coloneqq\\forall y\\bigl(\\delta_{\\tau,r}(x,y)\\to\\operatorname{Loc}_{x,r}(\\chi)\\bigr),\\quad y\\ne x.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BasicLoc}_{\\tau}\\coloneqq\\left\\{\\operatorname{Ex}\\left(\\bar u,\\bigwedge^{\\!*}\\langle\\neg\\delta_{\\tau,2r}(u_i,u_j)\\rangle_{1\\leq i&lt;j\\leq m}\\land\\bigwedge^{\\!*}\\left\\langle\\bigl(\\operatorname{Loc}_{x,r}(\\chi)\\bigr)[u_i/x]\\right\\rangle_{i=1}^m\\right)\\ \\middle|\\ \\begin{aligned}&amp;r\\in\\mathbb N,\\ m\\in\\mathbb N_{\\geq1},\\ x\\in\\mathrm{Var},\\ \\chi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_\\tau,\\ \\mathrm{FV}_\\tau(\\chi)\\subseteq\\{x\\},\\ x\\notin\\mathrm{BV}_\\tau(\\chi),\\\\&amp;\\bar u=(u_1,\\ldots,u_m)\\in(\\mathrm{Var}\\setminus(\\{x\\}\\cup\\mathrm{BV}_\\tau(\\chi)))^m,\\quad|\\operatorname{rng}(\\bar u)|=m\\end{aligned}\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BasicLoc}_{\\tau}\\coloneqq\\left\\{\\operatorname{Ex}\\left(\\bar u,\\bigwedge^{\\!*}\\langle\\neg\\delta_{\\tau,2r}(u_i,u_j)\\rangle_{1\\leq i&lt;j\\leq m}\\land\\bigwedge^{\\!*}\\left\\langle\\bigl(\\operatorname{Loc}_{x,r}(\\chi)\\bigr)[u_i/x]\\right\\rangle_{i=1}^m\\right)\\ \\middle|\\ \\begin{aligned}&amp;r\\in\\mathbb N,\\ m\\in\\mathbb N_{\\geq1},\\ x\\in\\mathrm{Var},\\ \\chi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_\\tau,\\ \\mathrm{FV}_\\tau(\\chi)\\subseteq\\{x\\},\\ x\\notin\\mathrm{BV}_\\tau(\\chi),\\\\&amp;\\bar u=(u_1,\\ldots,u_m)\\in(\\mathrm{Var}\\setminus(\\{x\\}\\cup\\mathrm{BV}_\\tau(\\chi)))^m,\\quad|\\operatorname{rng}(\\bar u)|=m\\end{aligned}\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{GaifNF}_{\\tau}\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\left\\{G\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\tau}\\ \\middle|\\ \\operatorname{BasicLoc}_{\\tau}\\subseteq G\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in G\\;(\\neg\\alpha\\in G)\\land\\forall\\alpha,\\beta\\in G\\;\\forall\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to,\\leftrightarrow\\}\\;((\\alpha\\circ\\beta)\\in G)\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{GaifNF}_{\\tau}\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\left\\{G\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\tau}\\ \\middle|\\ \\operatorname{BasicLoc}_{\\tau}\\subseteq G\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in G\\;(\\neg\\alpha\\in G)\\land\\forall\\alpha,\\beta\\in G\\;\\forall\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to,\\leftrightarrow\\}\\;((\\alpha\\circ\\beta)\\in G)\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>球距离使用无环 Gaifman 图；这与原书 Definition 6.20 允许环的版本有相同的最短路距离。相邻距离递归按 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\">\\(r\\)</span> 良基，束缚变量集与局部化按公式结构良基；限制中心变量不被绑定，再使用捕获规避替换，使每个局部式始终相对外层见证点取球。允许 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi\">\\(\\chi\\)</span> 没有自由变量，也允许零半径。基本局部句中的见证点两两距离大于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2r\">\\(2r\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>本书印刷页111的历史段落只指向 Gaifman 的局部性论文，没有提供这里整个正规形定义与证明。本条完成的是定义接口；对应存在性定理及其来源限制见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"1262398c29560e42\" href=\"?note=1262398c29560e42\" title=\"29-thm-gaifman\">29-thm-gaifman</a>。</p>\n<p>本次将辅助变量按既有变量枚举规范选择，并明确有限连接的括号及空序列值。公式仍是已有语法树，不另外引入未定义的 α 等价商；此项改变的是语法构造的确定性，不改变各公式的距离与局部性语义。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-vocab","status":"resolved","id":"28e86a5f0243a0ae","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-vocab]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"a3fa1d78e657e6a2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"711217f22972ffc0","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-atomic-formula","status":"resolved","id":"19d380b6c383f76b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-atomic-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-free-variable","status":"resolved","id":"db2b32546860e623","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-free-variable]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-bound-variable","status":"resolved","id":"85d0fb57b7114042","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-bound-variable]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-variable","status":"resolved","id":"ad08b66c5e54a436","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-variable]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-substitution","status":"resolved","id":"cb6b888b6edaf01c","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-substitution]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-variable","status":"resolved","id":"ad08b66c5e54a436","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{AtFml}_\\tau,\\mathrm{Fml}_\\tau,\\mathrm{Sent}_\\tau,\\mathrm{FV}_\\tau,\\mathrm{BV}_\\tau$ 取所列依赖。$\\mathrm{Var}=\\{x_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}$，索引单射取 [[29-df-variable]]；$x,y\\in\\mathrm{Var}$，$r,m\\in\\mathbb N$。$\\psi[t/x]$ 是 [[29-df-substitution]] 的捕获规避替换。","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-substitution","status":"resolved","id":"cb6b888b6edaf01c","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{AtFml}_\\tau,\\mathrm{Fml}_\\tau,\\mathrm{Sent}_\\tau,\\mathrm{FV}_\\tau,\\mathrm{BV}_\\tau$ 取所列依赖。$\\mathrm{Var}=\\{x_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}$，索引单射取 [[29-df-variable]]；$x,y\\in\\mathrm{Var}$，$r,m\\in\\mathbb N$。$\\psi[t/x]$ 是 [[29-df-substitution]] 的捕获规避替换。","embed":false},{"target":"29-thm-gaifman","status":"resolved","id":"1262398c29560e42","anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"本书印刷页111的历史段落只指向 Gaifman 的局部性论文，没有提供这里整个正规形定义与证明。本条完成的是定义接口；对应存在性定理及其来源限制见 [[29-thm-gaifman]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\tau=\\langle R_1^{(a_1)},\\ldots,R_s^{(a_s)}\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{Vocabulary}","display":false},{"tex":"a_j\\geq1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AtFml}_\\tau,\\mathrm{Fml}_\\tau,\\mathrm{Sent}_\\tau,\\mathrm{FV}_\\tau,\\mathrm{BV}_\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Var}=\\{x_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}","display":false},{"tex":"x,y\\in\\mathrm{Var}","display":false},{"tex":"r,m\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\psi[t/x]","display":false},{"tex":"D\\subseteq\\mathrm{Var}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{fr}(D,m)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Vert","display":false},{"tex":"\\bigwedge^{\\!*},\\bigvee^{\\!*}","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle\\theta_i\\rangle_{i=1}^t","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ex}(\\bar z,\\theta)","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar z\\in\\mathrm{Var}^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Adj}_\\tau(x,y)","display":false},{"tex":"z_1,\\ldots,z_{a_j}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{fr}(\\{x,y\\},a_j)","display":false},{"tex":"z","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{fr}(\\{x,y\\},1)_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Loc}_{x,r}","display":false},{"tex":"\\{\\chi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_\\tau:x\\notin\\mathrm{BV}_\\tau(\\chi)\\}","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to,\\leftrightarrow\\}","display":false},{"tex":"h_1(D)\\coloneqq\\min\\{i\\in\\mathbb N:x_i\\notin D\\},\\qquad h_{j+1}(D)\\coloneqq\\min\\{i\\in\\mathbb N:i>h_j(D)\\land x_i\\notin D\\},\\qquad\\operatorname{fr}(D,m)\\coloneqq\\langle x_{h_j(D)}\\rangle_{j=1}^m.","display":true},{"tex":"\\bigwedge^{\\!*}\\langle\\rangle\\coloneqq\\top,\\quad\\bigvee^{\\!*}\\langle\\rangle\\coloneqq\\bot,\\quad\\bigwedge^{\\!*}(\\langle\\theta\\rangle\\Vert\\bar\\eta)\\coloneqq\\theta\\land\\bigwedge^{\\!*}\\bar\\eta,\\quad\\bigvee^{\\!*}(\\langle\\theta\\rangle\\Vert\\bar\\eta)\\coloneqq\\theta\\lor\\bigvee^{\\!*}\\bar\\eta.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ex}(\\langle\\rangle,\\theta)\\coloneqq\\theta,\\qquad\\operatorname{Ex}(\\langle z\\rangle\\Vert\\bar u,\\theta)\\coloneqq\\exists z\\,\\operatorname{Ex}(\\bar u,\\theta).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Adj}_{\\tau}(x,y)\\coloneqq\\neg(x=y)\\land\\bigvee^{\\!*}\\left\\langle\\operatorname{Ex}\\left(\\operatorname{fr}(\\{x,y\\},a_j),R_j(z_1,\\ldots,z_{a_j})\\land\\bigvee^{\\!*}\\langle x=z_p\\land y=z_q\\rangle_{(p,q)\\in\\{1,\\ldots,a_j\\}^2}\\right)\\right\\rangle_{j=1}^s,\\qquad(z_1,\\ldots,z_{a_j})=\\operatorname{fr}(\\{x,y\\},a_j).","display":true},{"tex":"\\delta_{\\tau,0}(x,y)\\coloneqq x=y,\\qquad\\delta_{\\tau,r+1}(x,y)\\coloneqq\\delta_{\\tau,r}(x,y)\\lor\\exists z\\bigl(\\delta_{\\tau,r}(x,z)\\land\\operatorname{Adj}_{\\tau}(z,y)\\bigr),\\quad z=\\operatorname{fr}(\\{x,y\\},1)_1.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Loc}_{x,r}(\\theta)\\coloneqq\\theta\\quad(\\theta\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_\\tau),\\qquad\\operatorname{Loc}_{x,r}(\\neg\\chi)\\coloneqq\\neg\\operatorname{Loc}_{x,r}(\\chi),\\qquad\\operatorname{Loc}_{x,r}(\\chi\\circ\\eta)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Loc}_{x,r}(\\chi)\\circ\\operatorname{Loc}_{x,r}(\\eta).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Loc}_{x,r}(\\exists y\\,\\chi)\\coloneqq\\exists y\\bigl(\\delta_{\\tau,r}(x,y)\\land\\operatorname{Loc}_{x,r}(\\chi)\\bigr),\\quad\\operatorname{Loc}_{x,r}(\\forall y\\,\\chi)\\coloneqq\\forall y\\bigl(\\delta_{\\tau,r}(x,y)\\to\\operatorname{Loc}_{x,r}(\\chi)\\bigr),\\quad y\\ne x.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{BasicLoc}_{\\tau}\\coloneqq\\left\\{\\operatorname{Ex}\\left(\\bar u,\\bigwedge^{\\!*}\\langle\\neg\\delta_{\\tau,2r}(u_i,u_j)\\rangle_{1\\leq i<j\\leq m}\\land\\bigwedge^{\\!*}\\left\\langle\\bigl(\\operatorname{Loc}_{x,r}(\\chi)\\bigr)[u_i/x]\\right\\rangle_{i=1}^m\\right)\\ \\middle|\\ \\begin{aligned}&r\\in\\mathbb N,\\ m\\in\\mathbb N_{\\geq1},\\ x\\in\\mathrm{Var},\\ \\chi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_\\tau,\\ \\mathrm{FV}_\\tau(\\chi)\\subseteq\\{x\\},\\ x\\notin\\mathrm{BV}_\\tau(\\chi),\\\\&\\bar u=(u_1,\\ldots,u_m)\\in(\\mathrm{Var}\\setminus(\\{x\\}\\cup\\mathrm{BV}_\\tau(\\chi)))^m,\\quad|\\operatorname{rng}(\\bar u)|=m\\end{aligned}\\right\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{GaifNF}_{\\tau}\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\left\\{G\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\tau}\\ \\middle|\\ \\operatorname{BasicLoc}_{\\tau}\\subseteq G\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in G\\;(\\neg\\alpha\\in G)\\land\\forall\\alpha,\\beta\\in G\\;\\forall\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to,\\leftrightarrow\\}\\;((\\alpha\\circ\\beta)\\in G)\\right\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"r","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi","display":false},{"tex":"2r","display":false}],"bytes":5978,"backlinks":[{"id":"38909ffa6d1e85ce","anchor":"ref-60","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[29-df-gaifman-normal-form]]、[[29-thm-gaifman]] — Gaifman 范式与局部性"},{"id":"1262398c29560e42","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"805a7de3b1249a36","anchor":"ref-45","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[29-df-gaifman-normal-form]]"},{"id":"ecc0dd131d213345","anchor":"ref-77","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-df-gaifman-normal-form]]"}],"outgoing":["28e86a5f0243a0ae","a3fa1d78e657e6a2","711217f22972ffc0","19d380b6c383f76b","db2b32546860e623","85d0fb57b7114042","ad08b66c5e54a436","cb6b888b6edaf01c","1262398c29560e42"]}